# Normalise line endings for everyone on the team.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout rewrites every file to CRLF and `git status`
# reports files as modified when nothing actually changed. That already happened
# once on HealthController.java. `text=auto eol=lf` stores LF in the repository
# and lets each machine check out whatever it prefers.
#
# After adding this, run once to re-normalise existing files:
#   git add --renormalize .
#   git commit -m "chore: normalise line endings"

* text=auto eol=lf

# Scripts that must keep platform-specific endings to stay executable.
/mvnw    text eol=lf
*.sh     text eol=lf
*.cmd    text eol=crlf
*.bat    text eol=crlf

# Binary files - never touch these.
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.ico    binary
*.pdf    binary
*.jar    binary
*.zip    binary
*.pkl    binary
*.joblib binary
*.onnx   binary
*.h5     binary
